title: Front Camera Auto Pop-Up on Proximity Sensor Activation
raw_community_title: Fix front camera not popping up on screen when front sensor activated
category: Cameras and ADAS
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro & Lightning Community
source_sheet: F-150 Lightning FORScan Thread
notes: Forces front camera to pop up on screen when forward sensor is triggered. Applicable
  to trucks without Park Assist and BlueCruise.
steps:
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-16-01
  mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 3
    community_instruction: if old value 0-7 then add 8 (hex) to get new value (e.g.
      3=>B). If current value is 8-F, then this is not for you.
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: VehicleCfg_APAInterface (VCAPAI)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: VehicleCfg_PCAType (VCPCAT)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: VehicleCfg_PCAType (VCPCAT)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: VehicleCfg_PCAType (VCPCAT)
      target_state: Disabled
validation_status: validated
